  "name": "luh-2022-soups-olab",
  "notes": "Replication Package for the Eighteenth Symposium on Usable Privacy and Security (SOUPS 2022) paper: “If You Can’t Get Them to the Lab: Evaluating a Virtual Study Environment with Security Information Workers”.\r\n\r\nTo make our study reproducible and allow for easy access for meta-research, we publish a replication package containing the following documents: \r\n(1) study protocols for the cognitive walkthrough\r\n(2) the guided and the comparison study, including the study scenarios\r\n(3) the tasks descriptions\r\n(4) between-task surveys\r\n(5) end surveys\r\n",
